# toolchain/jasmin/SERIES
# =======================
#
# The patch series applied to the pin, in order: path relative to this
# directory, SHA-256 of the file. build.sh applies exactly these files,
# refuses a file whose hash differs, and refuses any *.patch file in
# patches/ or patches-simd/ that is not listed.
#
# The series is empty: the compiler is the pinned commit as published.
